            <ArticleTitle>Impaction of foreign body in right coronary ostium.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>150-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article deals with the impaction of an angiography catheter in the right coronary ostium and its subsequent retention as a broken foreign body. The case was managed by operative extraction and concomitant CABG. The management of such a case is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
